m><span class=title> <img src="http://www.ezboard.com/images/posticons/pi_mad.gif" align=absmiddle>  Phatteus Evangelion, Hallogen's Long Lost Prodigal Son?</span><hr size=1> Hello Members of the Abyss!<br>
<br>
My name is Phatteus Evangelion and I'm currently a 49th level Shadow Knight on Brell Serelis. I come to your domain seeking a new family as it seems more and more each day I have outgrown mine. I'm currently affilaited with a small guild known as the Advocates of Destruction. My heart once completely belonged to this strong knit family but for the past couple of months it seems the groups focus has been torwards everyone's younger character(s). I'm famaliar with the guild mainly because of Hallogen's Uber Shadow Knight. Ever since my character was younger and I saw him camping out at the Freeport docks, I stopped in awe of his characters dooming glow. As I inspected him I took screenshots of each item his character had equipped to research them later.  I wish I could say I was surprised but I know from first glance he was just as elite as I had thought.<br>
<br>
Many of you may not be famaliar with me. However, this is why I come to you. If any members of The Abyss seek assistance please feel free to contact me via email at Lo_Phat@Bigfoot.com or in game via the character name &quot;Phatteus&quot; as I am at your bid and call. Perhaps in the close future I may call you &quot;Family&quot; and this &quot;Home.&quot;<br>
<br>
Thanks in advance and I hope to speak with some of you soon!<br>
<br>
- Phatteus Evangelion (49th Shadow Knight)<br>
<br>
- Brad (in that place known as real life!)<br>
